  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conflict Resolution Department (CRD) Conflict Resolution Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme primarily funds key mediation organisations delivering against the UK&#x2019;s negotiation, mediation and peace process ambitions, specifically on bringing about negotiated political settlements that govern and end violence and refocusing peace processes as a central tool for conflict resolution, working with a range of national and international partners.</narrative>
  </description>
